201
00:09:38,365 --> 00:09:41,990
Jo grahak chup rehta hai, uska byaaj aksar wahi rehta hai.

202
00:09:41,990 --> 00:09:44,858
Ab woh galti, jo zyada tar parivaar karte hain.

203
00:09:44,858 --> 00:09:48,363
Woh EMI ko kiraaye ki tarah dekhte hain. Har mahine bharo,

204
00:09:48,363 --> 00:09:51,868
