205
00:09:51,868 --> 00:09:55,055
Byaaj ke baare mein bank se kabhi baat nahi hoti.

206
00:09:55,055 --> 00:09:58,560
Aur 20 saal baad pata chalta hai, ghar double mein pada.

207
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:01,290
Toh karein kya? Har saal statement dekho.

208
00:10:01,290 --> 00:10:03,240
Bonus ya extra paisa aaye,

209
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,970
toh uska kuch hissa prepayment mein daalo.

210
00:10:05,970 --> 00:10:08,700
Prepayment par saal kam karwao. Byaaj badhe,

211
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:12,990
toh bank se baat karo. Par emergency ka paisa alag rakho,

212
00:10:12,990 --> 00:10:16,890
sab loan mein mat jhonko. Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

213
00:10:16,890 --> 00:10:20,317
Amit aur Neha ka ghar wahi hai, EMI bhi wahi.

214
00:10:20,317 --> 00:10:24,087
Bas ab woh andhere mein nahi chal rahe. Unhe pata hai,

215
00:10:24,087 --> 00:10:26,829
har EMI ka kitna hissa kahan jaata hai.

216
00:10:26,829 --> 00:10:29,570
Aur yahi fark hai, loan lene wale mein,

217
00:10:29,570 --> 00:10:33,340
aur loan samajhne wale mein. Ghar wahi, par bill ab chhota.

218
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:39,347
Agle video mein baat karenge credit card ke minimum due ki,

219
00:10:39,347 --> 00:10:43,715
aur us jaal ki jo usme chhupa hai.

220
00:10:43,715 --> 00:10:47,538
Par usse pehle aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

221
00:10:47,538 --> 00:10:54,090
Kya aapne kabhi apne home loan ka statement khol kar dekha hai?

222
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:57,367
Haan ya na, comments mein likho.
